# Source audio for listening tests - licensed stock music, not ours to redistribute
*.mp3
# Except test fixtures: tones generated here, by Windows' own encoder, and ours to publish
!/desktop/src/test/resources/*.mp3

# One-off analysis of archived runs. They read artifacts/, which is not published, so a
# clone cannot run them. Kept locally, out of the tree.
/tools/analysis/

# Build instructions for the icon set, written for this repository and not for a reader of it.
/asset/README.md

# The release signing key, and the base64 of it that goes into a GitHub secret. This file is the
# application's identity: committed, anybody can publish as SoundMesh; lost, no install already
# out there can ever be updated again. It belongs offline and nowhere near a repository.
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.b64
